WEBVTT

00:05:28.699 --> 00:05:30.493
And that's true even for introverts.

00:05:31.327 --> 00:05:34.372
And then flow is the state
where we are so engaged and focused

00:05:34.413 --> 00:05:35.748
on whatever we're doing

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:37.583
that we can even lose track of time.

00:05:37.583 --> 00:05:40.211
You can think about an athlete
in the middle of a game,

00:05:40.252 --> 00:05:42.171
or a musician playing a piece of music.

00:05:42.171 --> 00:05:43.547
It's when we're in the zone.

00:05:43.547 --> 00:05:46.384
It's possible to be in flow
and not have fun,

00:05:46.384 --> 00:05:47.635
like if you're arguing,

00:05:47.635 --> 00:05:50.304
but you cannot have fun
if you're not in flow.

00:05:51.305 --> 00:05:54.350
So playfulness, connection and flow
all feel great on their own.

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:56.602
But when we experience all three at once,

00:05:56.644 --> 00:05:58.479
something magical happens.

00:05:58.813 --> 00:06:00.314
We have fun.